   "faq": {
    "items": [
     {
      "q": "Does it leave from the Eiffel Tower?",
      "a": "No, from Pont de l&rsquo;Alma (Port de la Conférence, 8th arrondissement), on the Right Bank. Parking is free during the cruise."
     },
     {
      "q": "How was the food?",
      "a": "Consistently excellent across all courses on my test dinner: beef carpaccio, sea bream and profiteroles stood out, all freshly prepared on board."
     },
     {
      "q": "Which menu should I book?",
      "a": "Harmonie (€114) for the classic dinner with kir and a glass of wine. Prestige (€135) adds sparkling wine, half a bottle of wine per person and a cheese option. Excellence (€170) adds Champagne, a cheese course and window-table priority."
     },
     {
      "q": "Can I go outside?",
      "a": "Yes, the full open-air rooftop deck is open throughout the cruise."
     },
     {
      "q": "Can kids come?",
      "a": "Yes: ages 4 to 12 pay €45 for starter, main, dessert and a soft drink, and under 4s go free (no meal)."
     }
    ]
   },
