   "faq": {
    "items": [
     {
      "q": "Does it leave from the Eiffel Tower?",
      "a": "Yes, from Pier 5/7 at Port de la Bourdonnais, right under the Eiffel Tower. Parking is free during the cruise."
     },
     {
      "q": "Will I get a window table?",
      "a": "Only on the higher tiers: Étoile and Découverte sit in the centre, Privilège guarantees a window table and Premier the front of the salon."
     },
     {
      "q": "How was the food?",
      "a": "Generally good: the scallop starter and chocolate tart were excellent, but my duckling fillet main was disappointingly bland."
     },
     {
      "q": "Can I go outside?",
      "a": "Only a little: there is a small open-air section at the back, and no roof deck during dinner."
     },
     {
      "q": "Which ticket should I book?",
      "a": "Étoile (€115): 3 courses, kir and wine (1 bottle per 4). Découverte (€139) adds Champagne. Privilège (€185) adds cheese and a guaranteed window table. Premier (€215): 5 courses and the front tables."
     }
    ]
